cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Deep Elements in teaching, outreach or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Deep Elements"
abstract: >-
  A browser mining puzzle game about the periodic table and the supply chains
  behind everyday technology. Players collect the real elements inside devices
  such as a smartphone, a wind turbine or an MRI scanner; each element comes
  with a sourced fact about what it does, where it comes from and how secure
  its supply is.
